@startuml
title Secuencia - búsqueda dinámica y normalización
autonumber
actor Usuario
boundary "SearchPage (JS)" as Page
control SearchController
entity SearchCriteria
control SearchOrchestrator
create SearchSession
database PdoSearchRepository as Repo
control ProviderClient
participant AlphaWS
participant BetaWS
participant GammaWS
control AlphaAdapter
control BetaAdapter
control GammaAdapter

Usuario -> Page : completa filtros y pulsa Buscar
Page -> SearchController : GET /api/search?... (HTTP)
SearchController -> SearchCriteria : fromQuery($_GET)
SearchCriteria --> SearchController : criterios normalizados
SearchController -> SearchOrchestrator : search(criteria)
SearchOrchestrator -> SearchSession : create(TTL)
SearchOrchestrator -> Repo : create(session, criteria, providers)
Repo --> SearchOrchestrator : persistida

par llamadas HTTP reales mediante curl_multi
  SearchOrchestrator -> ProviderClient : alpha /api/products
  ProviderClient -> AlphaWS : GET con filtros canónicos
  note right of AlphaWS
    PDO prepara SQL dinámico.
    Solo agrega predicados suministrados.
  end note
  AlphaWS --> ProviderClient : {provider, items[]}
else
  SearchOrchestrator -> ProviderClient : beta /api/products
  ProviderClient -> BetaWS : GET con filtros canónicos
  note right of BetaWS : PDO prepared statement
  BetaWS --> ProviderClient : {source, products[]}
else
  SearchOrchestrator -> ProviderClient : gamma /api/products
  ProviderClient -> GammaWS : GET con filtros canónicos
  note right of GammaWS : PDO prepared statement
  GammaWS --> ProviderClient : {market, results[]}
end

ProviderClient --> SearchOrchestrator : payloads + estado + duración
SearchOrchestrator -> AlphaAdapter : normalize(payload)
AlphaAdapter --> SearchOrchestrator : NormalizedProduct[]
SearchOrchestrator -> BetaAdapter : normalize(payload)
BetaAdapter --> SearchOrchestrator : NormalizedProduct[]
SearchOrchestrator -> GammaAdapter : normalize(payload)
GammaAdapter --> SearchOrchestrator : NormalizedProduct[]
SearchOrchestrator -> SearchOrchestrator : merge + global sort + limit
SearchOrchestrator -> Repo : saveResults(snapshot, statuses, warnings)
Repo --> SearchOrchestrator : cache temporal guardado
SearchOrchestrator --> SearchController : SearchResponse
SearchController --> Page : 200 JSON normalizado
Page --> Usuario : resultados, origen, ID y cuenta regresiva
@enduml

